              "text": " and excited for new things."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "en": "They also show us maybe some scary or worrying things.",
          "tc": "他們也向我們展示了一些可怕或令人擔憂的事情。",
          "englishTokens": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "They also show us maybe some scary or worrying things."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "en": "But they help us make the changes necessary for our lives to be the happiest we can possibly be.",
          "tc": "但它們幫助我們做出必要的改變，讓我們的生活盡可能幸福。",
          "englishTokens": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "But they help us "
            },
            {
              "type": "usage",
              "text": "make",
              "targetId": "usage-make-item",
              "instanceId": "marker-b2-ch4-slow-english-for-c1-advanced-dreams-039-01"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " the changes necessary for our lives to be the happiest we can possibly be."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "en": "Sometimes I think our dreams can make us appreciate and be thankful for things we might take for granted in our lives.",
          "tc": "有時我認為我們的夢想可以讓我們欣賞和感激生活中那些我們認為理所當然的事。",
          "englishTokens": [
