    {
      "id": "scene-11",
      "no": "11",
      "titleZh": "第 11 段",
      "titleEn": "Part 11",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "If you take someone or something for granted, maybe your dream will show you that person and show you that you need to appreciate that person more.",
          "tc": "如果你認為某人或某事是理所當然的，也許你的夢會向你展示那個人，並向你表明你需要更加欣賞那個人。",
          "englishTokens": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If you take someone or something for granted, maybe your dream will show you that person and show you that you need to appreciate that person more."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "en": "I think our dreams can sometimes tell us not to take something for granted.",
          "tc": "我認為我們的夢想有時可以告訴我們不要認為某些事情是理所當然的。",
          "englishTokens": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I think our dreams can sometimes tell us not to take something for granted."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "en": "Do you agree that dreams have meaning?",
          "tc": "你同意夢有意義嗎？",
