  "breakdowns": [
    {
      "id": "grammar-1",
      "sentence": "Hello, welcome back to my Slow English podcast, a podcast to practice your English listening for advanced learners.",
      "translation": "您好，歡迎回到我的慢速英語podcast，這是一​​個為高級學習者練習英語聽力的podcast。",
      "points": [
        {
          "label": "to 不定詞",
          "text": "to + 原形動詞",
          "note": "用來表示目的、補語或接在特定動詞後。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "grammar-2",
      "sentence": "When I say dreams, I'm referring to the dreams we have when we sleep.",
      "translation": "當我說夢時，我指的是我們睡覺時所做的夢。",
      "points": [
        {
          "label": "when 時間子句",
          "text": "when + 主詞 + 動詞",
          "note": "用 when 說明事情發生的時間或情境。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "grammar-3",
      "sentence": "They are the worlds we create inside our brain, our subconscious mind creating worlds, stories, and dreams while we sleep.",
      "translation": "它們是我們在大腦中創造的世界，我們的潛意識在我們睡覺時創造世界、故事和夢想。",
